<title>CANADA: Newbridge shares gain after article.</title>
<headline>Newbridge shares gain after article.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Newbridge Networks Corp rose in moderately heavy trade on Tuesday after a positive story in the Wall Street Journal newspaper.</p>
<p>&quot;It's going up because of the article and there's a selective resurgence in networking stocks,&quot; one analyst said.</p>
<p>Newbridge shares rose to 42.50 in Toronto before retracing slightly to trade 0.75 higher at 41.90.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
